                     ⛪ THE HIDDEN CHAPEL
================================================================================

There is writing upon the wall.

It is written in the common language of the land.

It appears to be inscribed in blood:

           T U R N    B A C K

You can feel the chill of ancient spirits lingering here.
But brave adventurers press on, for the chapel holds secrets
that cannot be found on the main path.

================================================================================
                   HIDDEN ROOMS & ls -a
================================================================================

Not all chambers are visible to the untrained eye.
Some rooms begin with a dot (.) making them HIDDEN.

COMMAND            PURPOSE
--------           --------
ls -a              Reveal ALL files, including hidden ones
ls -la             Detailed view of all files (hidden + visible)

Try it now:

    $ ls -a

You may discover doorways you never knew existed.

