================================================================================
                  PATHS FROM THE CHAPEL
================================================================================

The chapel connects to mysterious areas:

    courtyard/     An open area with a fountain and strange rags
    graveyard/     A solemn resting place with hidden tombs

Each path teaches different skills. The graveyard holds
secrets visible only with ls -a (look for the mausoleum).

NAVIGATION:
    cd courtyard    Explore the chapel grounds
    cd graveyard    Visit the resting place of the fallen
    cd ..           Return to the entrance

